00:02:09.017 --> 00:02:31.846
Life in Cambodia is busy and friendly. In Phnom Penh, people take a tuk-tuk ride to work. Saturday is market day, and street food is everywhere. On holidays, families make a pagoda visit and receive a monk blessing. Every year, people watch the Royal Ploughing ceremony. Every evening, the family dinner is the most important meal.

